From fcaabae8c3fc8e38079f37d9de05cd483325b2bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:13:58 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add RIME CJK input method to the virtual keyboard
 (overlay/asteroidos)

Integrate librime into asteroid-virtualkeyboard and add wearable-sized
Chinese layouts:

- 0001-add-rime-plugin-and-layouts.patch: register the RIME input method
  plugin and layout hooks.
- rimeinputmethod.{h,cpp}: librime engine wrapper.
- layouts/{zh_CN,zh_HK,zh_TW}: Pinyin, Bopomofo, and Jyutping layouts.
- default.nix: link librime, copy the plugin sources and layouts, and
  pre-deploy common schemas with the host rime_deployer.
---
